<figure class="think-figure think-figure--wide think-spectrum">
  <figcaption class="think-figure__caption">
    <strong class="think-figure__heading">What AI should automate</strong>
    <span class="think-figure__summary">The column a task lands in is a design decision, not a model decision.</span>
  </figcaption>
  <ol class="think-spectrum__columns">
    <li class="think-spectrum__column think-spectrum__column--low">
      <span class="think-figure__kicker">Low stakes</span>
      <strong class="think-figure__title">AI handles it</strong>
      <ul class="think-spectrum__examples">
        <li>Routine customer questions</li>
        <li>Call wrap-up notes, cut from minutes to about 30 seconds</li>
        <li>Summarizing a long ticket thread</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li class="think-spectrum__column think-spectrum__column--middle">
      <span class="think-figure__kicker">The messy middle</span>
      <strong class="think-figure__title">AI acts within limits</strong>
      <ul class="think-spectrum__examples">
        <li>Refunds under a set dollar amount</li>
        <li>Replies drafted, not sent</li>
        <li>QA scores on every call, spot-checked by a person</li>
        <li>Hands off to a person when unsure</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li class="think-spectrum__column think-spectrum__column--high">
      <span class="think-figure__kicker">High stakes</span>
      <strong class="think-figure__title">A person decides, or the steps are fixed</strong>
      <ul class="think-spectrum__examples">
        <li>Payroll and finance</li>
        <li>Health</li>
        <li>Legal paperwork</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p class="think-figure__axis think-spectrum__axis">
    <span>Cheap mistakes</span>
    <span class="think-figure__arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="visually-hidden">to</span>
    <span>Costly mistakes</span>
  </p>
</figure>
